#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""omamigrate - move your Omarchy from one machine to another.

A standalone, deterministic migration app for Omarchy. It inventories
everything you customized (configs, themes, plugins, packages, defaults),
packs it into a portable bundle, and restores it on the new machine -
with automatic backups, package installs, plugin re-clones and a restart.

Usage:
  omamigrate                 open the dashboard (GUI)
  omamigrate agent           let your default agent walk you through it
  omamigrate scan [--json]   inventory this machine
  omamigrate pack [...]      build a bundle
  omamigrate serve [...]     serve the latest bundle over the LAN
  omamigrate unpack <b>      inspect a bundle
  omamigrate apply <b> [...] restore on this machine
  omamigrate verify <b>      check what a bundle restored

Everything is a deterministic script. The agent (if you want one) only
narrates and asks questions.
"""

